Z||000002||Monkeyman||10-21-2001||10:03 PM||||Are you referring to the insert in the wing itself?  They are supposed to be available from the dealer, but I've tried and tried and wasn't able to get any.  You might have better luck.  I've used some kind of plastic, expandable anchors from the local hardware store before with great results.  Plenty of highway miles with no loosening at all.||||reg||1
